# WAFA InboxAI — Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) Architecture
# Do NOT embed private AI API keys or OAuth client secrets into APK build configs.
# Users configure their own AI provider keys (Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter, Hugging Face,
# Cloudflare Workers AI, XPIKI) inside the encrypted API Provider Manager after installation.
#
# Optional non-secret default deployment URLs can be configured inside the app Settings
# or during first-launch Onboarding (Step 3).
